2027130,home child care definition,msmarco_passage_62_770185382,"Child Care Market Definition. The child care market consists of the sales of child care services such as babysitting and learning services and related goods by entities (organizations, sole traders and partnerships) that provide care for infants or children either in the home of the child, in the home of the registered child caregiver or in a child care center.",1,家庭儿童保育的定义,"家庭儿童保育的定义. Child Care Market Definition. The child care market consists of the sales of child care services such as babysitting and learning services and related goods by entities (organizations, sole traders and partnerships) that provide care for infants or children either in the home of the child, in the home of the registered child caregiver or in a child care center.",2
